{"name": "Vagabones", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"84\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157380/extras/f10f03d654e949f1e41c15e938939827.avif?t=1785984486\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this action-adventure roguelike, you play as the four backup heroes Neo, Chaz, Coby and Miley, who are sent on a quest by Queen Charlatte to defeat the Calico King and save the world from destruction.<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"472\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157380/extras/2555fff04ea6b754b4d305f93d632d26.poster.avif?t=1785984486\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157380/extras/2555fff04ea6b754b4d305f93d632d26.webm?t=1785984486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157380/extras/2555fff04ea6b754b4d305f93d632d26.mp4?t=1785984486\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"84\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157380/extras/4c65e2eba6f60811d61c228c9a277bcc.avif?t=1785984486\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run presents new rooms, puzzles, enemies, and rewards to discover. As you progress, the King grows stronger, offering a fresh challenge with every playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"472\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157380/extras/3e3f1c5ac01598594a64310b73175905.poster.avif?t=1785984486\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157380/extras/3e3f1c5ac01598594a64310b73175905.webm?t=1785984486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157380/extras/3e3f1c5ac01598594a64310b73175905.mp4?t=1785984486\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"84\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157380/extras/5a39a992f1623f20e130790cf5023a4f.avif?t=1785984486\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each class has their own unique set of skills and upgrades that vary from run to run. Try out different combinations to find the best build for your play style. Uncover the secrets of the Shadowmoon kingdom and unlock new powers to aid you in future runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"472\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157380/extras/8df0ed976e8eceeb645ef1a11894dac5.poster.avif?t=1785984486\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157380/extras/8df0ed976e8eceeb645ef1a11894dac5.webm?t=1785984486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157380/extras/8df0ed976e8eceeb645ef1a11894dac5.mp4?t=1785984486\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"84\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157380/extras/6dc1b259d6b6e4193dc6c9dfd2865dfc.avif?t=1785984486\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go  solo or team up with up to four players in local and online co-op. Work together to defeat enemies, solve puzzles, and play minigames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"472\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157380/extras/ac1aa00bfb1cf44e59040fe977454487.poster.avif?t=1785984486\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157380/extras/ac1aa00bfb1cf44e59040fe977454487.webm?t=1785984486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157380/extras/ac1aa00bfb1cf44e59040fe977454487.mp4?t=1785984486\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Vagabones is a class-based roguelike action-adventure game for 1-4 players! Battle fierce foes, play minigames, solve puzzles, and collect treasures as you venture through the Shadowmoon Kingdom to defeat the Calico King!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157380/6451941774bfb3c58578c856961aa9d40294f8a0/header.jpg?t=1785984486", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action Roguelike", "Dungeon Crawler", "Hack and Slash", "Action", "Roguelite", "Multiplayer"], "developers": "Calibrated Games LLC", "publishers": "Calibrated Games LLC", "release_date": "2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3157380", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "3 August 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/JO5hsCZOeLk", "first_seen": 1785708000.0, "review_rank": 169}